{"id":"n54827-3-7","stage":4,"title":"묘하다 · 绝妙","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54827-3-7-1","ko":"여길 어떻게 빠져나가지?","zh":"这里要怎么出去呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여길","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠져나가지?","meaning":"摆脱，逃出去，流失","explanation":"빠져나가다：摆脱，逃出去，流失；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"빠져나가다","audio":"/audio/5d317cd1140b56bccc13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15644","senseId":"1","lemma":"빠져나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"5d317cd1140b56bc","term":"빠져나가다","zh":"摆脱，逃出去，流失","audio":"/audio/5d317cd1140b56bccc13.mp3","entryId":"15644","definition":"从受限制的环境或界限里出去。","pronunciation":["빠ː저나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fa7984ca8aca01ce07dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54827-3-7-2","ko":"나에게 묘한 계획이 있어.","zh":"我有个特别的计划。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나에게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"묘한","meaning":"绝妙，绝佳","explanation":"묘하다：绝妙，绝佳；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"묘하다","audio":"/audio/480a26d2ee1a48f86b69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54827","senseId":"3","lemma":"묘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계획이","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"480a26d2ee1a48f8","term":"묘하다","zh":"绝妙，绝佳","audio":"/audio/480a26d2ee1a48f86b69.mp3","entryId":"54827","definition":"才华或手艺等极其卓越。","pronunciation":["묘ː하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/160d13ff42715ef8b2c8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.411,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54827","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2377,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这里要怎么出去呢？","我有个特别的计划。","这幅画真是令人感动啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这里要怎么出去呢？","我有个特别的计划。","这幅画真是令人感动啊。"],"answer":1}]}
